    "annotations": {
        "summary": "tokens-usage: a verified Webacy depeg webhook was recorded but not forwarded to the jobs worker",
        "description": "POST /hooks/webacy verified and stored a DEPEG_TIER_CHANGE delivery but the nudge to POST /jobs/reconcile-stablecoin-depeg on the assets jobs service failed in the last 15 minutes (outcome=forward_failed). The `why` field names the cause: jobs_url_unset (TOKENS_CLOUDRUN_ASSETS_JOBS_URL missing on the usage service), id_token_unavailable / id_token_error (metadata server), http_401 or http_403 (the usage runtime SA lacks roles/run.invoker on the worker, or its email is not listed in the worker's TOKENS_CRON_INVOKER_SA), http_5xx, timeout, fetch_error. The mint is still reconciled by the next 4-hourly sweep, so this is a latency regression rather than a missed advisory.",
        "runbook_url": "https://github.com/solana-foundation/tokens/blob/main/docs/operations/asset-advisory-runbook.md#automated-depeg-advisories"
    }
}
